    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like Wolfram Alpha and ChatGPT to check my derivations and clarify concepts. It helped me verify my work quickly and offered alternative explanations. However, I was cautious—never fully trusting it to replace my own reasoning. It’s a useful assistant, not a teacher, and I always double-checked its outputs.",
